 104:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 105:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   =============================================
 106:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 107:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   The compilation define  USE_HAL_LPTIM_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 108:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 109:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 110:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   Use Function HAL_LPTIM_RegisterCallback() to register a callback.
 111:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   HAL_LPTIM_RegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 112:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   the Callback ID and a pointer to the user callback function.
 113:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 114:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   Use function HAL_LPTIM_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the
 115:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   default weak function.
 116:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   HAL_LPTIM_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 117:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   and the Callback ID.
 118:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 119:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   These functions allow to register/unregister following callbacks:
 120:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 121:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback         : LPTIM Base Msp Init Callback.
 122:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback       : LPTIM Base Msp DeInit Callback.
 123:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) CompareMatchCallback    : Compare match Callback.
 124:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) AutoReloadMatchCallback : Auto-reload match Callback.
 125:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) TriggerCallback         : External trigger event detection Callback.
 126:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) CompareWriteCallback    : Compare register write complete Callback.
 127:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) AutoReloadWriteCallback : Auto-reload register write complete Callback.
 128:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) DirectionUpCallback     : Up-counting direction change Callback.
 129:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****     (+) DirectionDownCallback   : Down-counting direction change Callback.
 130:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 131:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 132:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   By default, after the Init and when the state is HAL_LPTIM_STATE_RESET
 133:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   all interrupt callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 134:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   examples HAL_LPTIM_TriggerCallback(), HAL_LPTIM_CompareMatchCallback().
 135:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 136:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 137:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are reset to the legacy weak
 138:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   functionalities in the Init/DeInit only when these callbacks are null
 139:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   (not registered beforehand). If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the Init/DeInit
 140:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand)
 141:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 142:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 143:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_LPTIM_STATE_READY state only.
 144:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit that can be registered/unregistered
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccCFMTgI.s 			page 4


 145:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   in HAL_LPTIM_STATE_READY or HAL_LPTIM_STATE_RESET state,
 146:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 147:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 148:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   using HAL_LPTIM_RegisterCallback() before calling DeInit or Init function.
 149:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 150:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   [..]
 151:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   When The compilation define USE_HAL_LPTIM_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 152:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 153:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 154:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
 155:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   @endverbatim
 156:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   ******************************************************************************
 157:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   */
 158:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** 
