 512:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c **** /**
 513:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   * @brief  Start the LPTIM PWM generation.
