 517:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   * @param  Pulse Specifies the compare value.
 518:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *         This parameter must be a value between 0x0000 and 0xFFFF.
